// spec: 12 Runtime panics; 4 Types as values
// panics: type-expr
// A name in a type expression that evaluates to neither a tag nor a constructor panics when the
// expression is reached, as an unknown is target does; the checker rejects it.
var config = 1
println("before")
println(type(Array[config]))

// expect
// out: before
// exit: 1
// err: config is not a type
